1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,125
Your RAG system just gave a wrong answer.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:07,550
Before you touch the prompt, or switch
models, check retrieval.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,400
Ask, in order.

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,300
Is the answer even in your documents?

5
00:00:13,917 --> 00:00:17,617
Did retrieval find it, in the
top 200 candidates?

6
00:00:18,217 --> 00:00:21,717
Did it survive reranking, and
make it into the prompt?

7
00:00:22,317 --> 00:00:25,717
Only then, ask whether the model
used it correctly.

8
00:00:26,717 --> 00:00:29,342
Most wrong answers start in retrieval.

9
00:00:29,642 --> 00:00:32,817
And retrieval is the cheapest
part to measure.

10
00:00:33,817 --> 00:00:36,317
The full design is on vidyal.ai.
